      <h1>Sun Life Coverage for Wellness Care <em>Paramedical Benefits, Claims and Spending Accounts</em></h1>
      <p>This guide explains how Sun Life group benefits usually treat the wellness care listed on WellFinder, including physiotherapy, massage therapy, naturopathy and psychology. It walks through claiming in the my Sun Life app, direct billing at clinics, and the spending accounts many Sun Life plans include.</p>
      <p>Every Sun Life plan is built with an employer, so your categories, maximums and rules come from your own plan. Check your coverage in the app before you book, and treat this guide as a map of what to look for.</p>
      <p class="byline">By WellFinder · November 2026 · 5 min read</p>
    </div>
      </div>

  </section>

